                        _value="&lt;p>An external partner operates an Assistance service (e.g. support in emergency situations, medical and legal assistance, reservation of hotels and restaurants, ordering tickets or flower delivery service) within Switzerland or abroad, on behalf of UBS. The name of the external partner may be obtained at any time from the UBS Platinum Service Center (Tel.: +41-44-828 31 31). The Applicant expressly agrees that, when Assistance services are used, UBS may disclose the Applicant's last name and first names to the external partner, as well as the information that the Applicant has a valid UBS Platinum Card.&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>To this extent, UBS is released from its obligation to maintain banking secrecy and data protection.&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;In order to fulfill its duties, the external partner needs this data and the data that the Applicant discloses to the external partner. The Applicant accepts that the external partner may use the services of third parties within Switzerland and abroad in order to fulfill its duties and in particular accepts that such parties shall obtain knowledge of the Applicant's data to the extent that this is necessary for performing the relevant duties with due care. The Applicant is aware that data sent outside Switzerland is no longer covered by Swiss law. The Applicant acknowledges that such data is sent to countries that do not guarantee data protection comparable to Swiss legislation. The Applicant has the right to revoke this declaration of consent at any time by cutting up the credit card and returning it to UBS.&lt;/p>&#xa;"
